1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh78euRTUOgswqES10o7s0f2zr4WlAw8uhUEQ1ZOcszQXgBsgtLa5CNApJMseoxbAyifYvlLLe2LXZ2INlkqGLthhH7DwRFaYCOuiMsFuD2oP6JpZaNnE7YjfriYheQdf-kzbFnMBQIrRUVXSVcAd_U3yxhrE38fqzEgV7NB4Ic6_dyvxKd5JylQb7MLc8u\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh78euRTUOgswqES10o7s0f2zr4WlAw8uhUEQ1ZOcszQXgBsgtLa5CNApJMseoxbAyifYvlLLe2LXZ2INlkqGLthhH7DwRFaYCOuiMsFuD2oP6JpZaNnE7YjfriYheQdf-kzbFnMBQIrRUVXSVcAd_U3yxhrE38fqzEgV7NB4Ic6_dyvxKd5JylQb7MLc8u\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjxhQvksujhkr5xh1bJWNvBV3L6G3KVgD2DIVGh3Il1qN5I-lSdkA6C09_QJEAm2hihdVSZZXEmBbL3VMVKGabkdIES6zq5V5LFKn7DELHbycZ04zGIsiGZoeFt829Hp_VM313B5KlASS9WdOnb-DKg_Ojn2S0d2Fk9k1iIXmDcc9TLTNpJ-L5P17KjiOhX\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjxhQvksujhkr5xh1bJWNvBV3L6G3KVgD2DIVGh3Il1qN5I-lSdkA6C09_QJEAm2hihdVSZZXEmBbL3VMVKGabkdIES6zq5V5LFKn7DELHbycZ04zGIsiGZoeFt829Hp_VM313B5KlASS9WdOnb-DKg_Ojn2S0d2Fk9k1iIXmDcc9TLTNpJ-L5P17KjiOhX\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjwBK0WUyyAVlHdzrl0RLsvr_m0xD2XXGc41R3G_F_KvfksRwoET5swLnm70TkN2wwTRgu-rK591XUmnsWiDqUcGQEeFmyyPgO_XQwLWV1M19NJXgWRnMWC83gY5XdbmmlD4O4brqEIlIjB2gf9rouIZ-871h5sScBRxrM2mUmlU1reBxEFuTNtuo8PScTr\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"516\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjwBK0WUyyAVlHdzrl0RLsvr_m0xD2XXGc41R3G_F_KvfksRwoET5swLnm70TkN2wwTRgu-rK591XUmnsWiDqUcGQEeFmyyPgO_XQwLWV1M19NJXgWRnMWC83gY5XdbmmlD4O4brqEIlIjB2gf9rouIZ-871h5sScBRxrM2mUmlU1reBxEFuTNtuo8PScTr=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi5OUk7O_VeTGx8cL2CxPyFodj-DVF28t9mnG8-1IT393CWzaIeoNoH4-7joZ8Dkvnh4bSlTb7LMT--q6QOkLUYxT1V1CtVKkcTx9k7gH3msK4ihJD4tmYBACyw6OA9D7xY-yDcZ2HZ5oZLE2qaySBRDjKmWbny-R5_N9x55usE-1Wtj5slw3Mlez6zHtfj\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3038\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi5OUk7O_VeTGx8cL2CxPyFodj-DVF28t9mnG8-1IT393CWzaIeoNoH4-7joZ8Dkvnh4bSlTb7LMT--q6QOkLUYxT1V1CtVKkcTx9k7gH3msK4ihJD4tmYBACyw6OA9D7xY-yDcZ2HZ5oZLE2qaySBRDjKmWbny-R5_N9x55usE-1Wtj5slw3Mlez6zHtfj=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><br /><br /></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">透早日頭就精神飽tīnn，kā規个世界tshiō kah光iānn-iānn，看著tsiah-nī好ê天氣，我心內hit个愛tshit-thô ê靈魂又koh擋bē tiâu--ah。想著昨hng tī手機仔有看著人leh分享旗津ê風景，好，就是伊--ah。行！來去！</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">火車坐到高雄車頭了後換坐捷運，tī月台就ē-tàng直接行到捷運ê通道，拄好uì今仔日透早開放</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: x-small;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">，有夠好運--ê，án-ne就m̄免樓頂樓跤tī-leh peh起peh落--ah！Tī哈瑪星站落車了後，去租公共跤踏車，騎去坐船過去旗津，就開始今仔日ê旅程--looh。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">我今仔日beh來去走揣一个號做『星空隧道』ê所在，看地圖是tī燈塔附近，án-ne就先去燈塔行行--leh。日頭實在siunn熱情--ah，透中晝ê時曝kah ná行汗ná流，m̄敢siunn延tshiân，趕緊揣一个好角度hip一張燈塔kah藍天白雲ê合相，in真正是上sù配ê一對，按怎看按怎suí。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">開手機仔ê地圖起來看，是ài行uì炮台hia去，我心內ná行ná giâu疑：tsia to kan-na炮台niâ，哪ē有啥mih磅空--neh？透中晝真正有夠熱ê熱，se̍h來se̍h去揣kah人kiōng-beh hōo日頭曝昏--去--ah。先mài揣--ah，來去食中晝khah要緊，食kah一半ê時，tsiah雄雄想著ē-sái tī手機仔頂kuân揣人分享ê影片來看--啊，有影有夠giàn頭to tio̍h。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tsit步真正有效，就án-ne我uì另外hit爿開始騎，來到港口ê時，想bē到hōo我看著郵輪tng beh入港，天公伯--à今仔日tsiok疼惜--我--ê。頭起先tī peh去燈塔ê半路就看著軍艦駛--入-來，tsit-má koh看著tsiah kuân、tsiah大隻ê郵輪tī我ê面頭前沓沓仔駛--過，我緊ná kā船頂ê遊客ia̍t手，ná用手機仔kā tsit个景象記錄--落-來。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">跤踏車騎tī海邊ê樹林仔內，lóng無人，心內有淡薄仔驚驚，想bē到騎到盡磅看--著--ê是山壁kah海手牽手leh跳舞。我m̄知影旗津有tsiah-nī suí ê風景，ē-tàng聽著海湧拍tī石壁ê聲音，看著tī海水浴場hit爿看bē著ê海，tsiok suí tsiok suí--ê。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tsia是磅空ê另外hit頭，伊ê名號做旗津灣峽。『星空隧道』，我總算揣著你--ah，雖bóng日頭tsiok炎，天氣tsiok熱，hōo人tsiok忝--ê，m̄-koh我ê心內tsiok歡喜、tsiok滿足--ê。今仔日ê旗津行踏，ē tiâu tī我心內上深上深ê所在。</span></div></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: x-small;\">1 編註：高雄車頭kah高雄捷運ê連通道tī今年8月11開放。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; text-align: left;\"><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleuse